  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "multi-hit then charge through frontal area",
    "skill1": "form pact with left and right allies at battle start, continuously increasing their stats",
    "skill2": "deal damage and stun nearby enemies twice",
    "skill3": "battle haste increase",
    "skill4": "enhanced bond continuously accumulates bonuses while partners live",
    "skill5": "ultimate converts portion of damage dealt to self-healing"
  },
  "play_overview": "Sonja forms a **pact with left and right allies at battle start**, continuously raising their stats while all three remain alive. Her ultimate delivers **multi-hit damage** then charges through a frontal area, converting a portion of damage dealt to **self-healing**. She also **stuns nearby enemies twice** with her area skill for soft control at the front. Enhanced bond accumulates bonuses over time while partners survive, and battle **haste growth** keeps her rotation fluid. She is a **frontline buffer** who needs flanking allies to realize her pact value. Without adjacent partners or dense enemy clusters, her buffs and stun swings underwhelm.",
  "counter_overview": "Sonja's Arena threat is the **battle-start pact** that continuously buffs her **left and right allies** — preferring the front — while all three live; her multi-hit charge is secondary. The fight hinges on whether those **flanking partners** survive long enough for bond bonuses to snowball. **Priority-delete the pact allies** with high-damage melee like [[Himmel]] or [[Athalia]], or [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]] if they park a rear carry on her flank. **Race** your own carry with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]] before her haste growth locks the front — Tempest Thrusts is **control-immune** for the full cast, so do not rely on ult-cancel there."
